---
title: HTTPS archive · port claim
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px

    [*] --> reuse : macOS
    [*] --> strict : other hosts
    reuse --> relist : every address bound
    reuse --> strict : a bind failed
    state relist <<choice>>
    relist --> claimed : [addresses unchanged]
    relist --> strict : [addresses changed]
    strict --> claimed : [port free]
    strict --> retry : [bind refused]
    retry --> strict : every 500 ms, 35 s
    retry --> refused : [35 s passed]
    claimed --> [*]

    note right of reuse
        SO_REUSEADDR, no SO_REUSEPORT:
        wildcard, loopback and each
        interface address, exactly.
        TIME_WAIT does not block it;
        another listener does.
    end note
    note right of relist
        getifaddrs again after
        binding; it must match.
    end note
    note left of retry
        Old path: waits out the
        retired Caddy's TIME_WAIT.
    end note

    class claimed ok
    class retry wait
    class refused fail
